  <head>
    <ce:title>Comparative electrochemical analysis and energy density evaluation of transition metal oxide cathode materials for lithium-ion batteries</ce:title>
    <ce:abstract>
      <ce:simple-para>Layered and olivine structured cathode materials exhibit distinct electrochemical operational characteristics. Here, we systematically compile the stoichiometry, specific discharge capacity, operating voltage, and energy density of leading lithium cathode chemistries.</ce:simple-para>
    </ce:abstract>
  </head>
